The evidence points to one root cause: ts-route-service, with database calls slowing inside it. Its effect reaches the dashboard through several callers.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-route-service",
      "fault_kind": "database_call_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, count(*) n, avg(duration)/1e6 avg_ms, quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND span_name LIKE 'SELECT ts.route%' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1", "claim": "Route-service SELECT ts.route_stations and ts.route_distances DB spans average about 140ms in the incident window."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT 'normal' p, count(*) n, avg(duration)/1e6 avg_ms, quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND span_name='GET /api/v1/routeservice/routes' UNION ALL SELECT 'abnormal', count(*), avg(duration)/1e6, quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6 FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND span_name='GET /api/v1/routeservice/routes'", "claim": "Route-service GET /routes p95 rises from about 7ms in normal period to about 11.5s in incident."},
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT 'abn' p, avg(value) v FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND metric='container.cpu.usage' UNION ALL SELECT 'nor', avg(value) FROM normal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND metric='container.cpu.usage'", "claim": "Route-service container CPU is low in the incident, so the slowness is not CPU saturation."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-route-service", "to": "ts-route-plan-service",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT c.service_name child_svc, p.service_name parent_svc, count(*) n, quantile_cont(p.duration,0.95)/1e6 parent_p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE c.service_name='ts-route-service' AND p.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Route-plan spans calling route-service rise to about 3.4s p95 during the incident."}]},
    {"from": "ts-route-plan-service", "to": "ts-travel-plan-service",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT c.service_name child_svc, p.service_name parent_svc, count(*) n, quantile_cont(p.duration,0.95)/1e6 parent_p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE c.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND p.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Travel-plan calls to route-plan take about 3.5s p95 during the incident."}]},
    {"from": "ts-route-service", "to": "ts-basic-service",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT c.service_name child_svc, p.service_name parent_svc, count(*) n, quantile_cont(p.duration,0.95)/1e6 parent_p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE c.service_name='ts-route-service' AND p.service_name='ts-basic-service' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Basic-service calls into route-service take about 800ms p95 during the incident."}]},
    {"from": "ts-basic-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, count(*) n, quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' GROUP BY 1", "claim": "Dashboard p95 rises to about 6s in the incident, consistent with degraded downstream calls via basic-service."}]}
  ]
}
```

